  "content": "<html><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HKSjwdn/Living-Things.jpg\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> <strong>为我的世界添加各种新的生物，使世界感觉更加生动</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">游戏内关于生物/物品的信息通过<strong>Patchouli</strong> (由Vazkii提供)&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此下载</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">(非必需但<strong>强烈建议</strong>)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组适用于Forge、Fabric(自1.18.2起)和NeoForge(自1.20.4起)。请查看文件标签以查看所有版本。</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fabric版本需要Fabric-API&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">获取它</a></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px\">有关生物/物品的详细信息请访问<strong>wiki&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点我</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">有关游戏内图片，请参阅图库。</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" rel=\"nofollow\">大象</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" rel=\"nofollow\">长颈鹿</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" rel=\"nofollow\">狮子</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" rel=\"nofollow\">鲨鱼</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" rel=\"nofollow\">企鹅</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PShrSK2/x170-elephant.png\" alt=\"Elephant\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/d4v4Vk38/x170-giraffe-1.png\" alt=\"Giraffe\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWPR0c5y/x170-lion.png\" alt=\"Lion\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9kGxr6Mk/x170-shark.png\" alt=\"Shark\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z6SkjYSc/x170-penguin.png\" alt=\"Penguin\"> </a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" rel=\"nofollow\">鸵鸟</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" rel=\"nofollow\">火烈鸟</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\">螃蟹</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" rel=\"nofollow\">蝠鲼</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" rel=\"nofollow\">浣熊</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z12Wtz4W/x170-ostrich.png\" alt=\"Ostrich\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/n8nRjdgs/x170-flamingo.png\" alt=\"Flamingo\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zhPLtBkR/x170-crab-red.png\" alt=\"Crab\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4n7jGDDL/x170-mantaray-blue.png\" alt=\"Mantaray\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YBndBzHc/x170-raccoon.png\" alt=\"Raccoon\"> </a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" rel=\"nofollow\">猫头鹰</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" rel=\"nofollow\">古代烈焰人</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" rel=\"nofollow\">考拉</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜗牛</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" rel=\"nofollow\">猴子</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ymP9Qjbv/x170-owl-brown.png\" alt=\"Owl\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/CpW4Kx6c/x170-ancient-blaze.png\" alt=\"Ancient-Blaze\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9k24KZsm/x170-koala.png\" alt=\"Koala\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dJ1vdgjq/x170-snail-blue.png\" alt=\"Snail\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/99FHb035/x170-monkey.png\" alt=\"Monkey\"> </a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" rel=\"nofollow\">下界骑士</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘑菇人</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" rel=\"nofollow\">海马</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" rel=\"nofollow\">幼末影龙</a></strong></span></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" rel=\"nofollow\">孔雀</a></strong></span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/q3F0xV3H/x170-nether-knight.png\" alt=\"Nether-Knight\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rK4xbM0p/x170-shroomie-red.png\" alt=\"Shroomie\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/27R8skfB/x170-seahorse-blue.png\" alt=\"Seahorse\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TD4RGbsB/x170-baby-ender-dragon.png\" alt=\"Baby-Enderdragon\"> </a></td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tGS4jmy/x170-peacock.png\" alt=\"Peacock\"> </a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"Divider\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您对模组有任何疑问，或者想了解即将推出的功能： </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎加入我的&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a></span></p></html>",
